JK Pvt Ltd had a strong FY 2025-26. Revenue grew 15.5% to ₹4,850 lakhs, gross margin improved from 38.5% to 40.0%, and net profit rose 45% to ₹546 lakhs. The business generated ₹640 lakhs of operating cash flow, funded ₹310 lakhs of capital expenditure from internal accruals, and reduced borrowings by ₹180 lakhs.
